WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:36.333
At the beginning of Chapter 16, Lord Krishna,

2
00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:39.666
in the first verse, identifies two types of nature –

3
00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:43.333
the divine that is daivi, and the
demoniac that is asuri.

4
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.333
This distinction explains why people behave

5
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:48.458
so differently from each other.

6
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:52.125
Lord Krishna begins first with the divine nature –

7
00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:52.875
the qualities

8
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:55.750
that lead a seeker toward liberation.

9
00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.875
These qualities are the means
of spiritual progress,

10
00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:02.250
that every seeker should cultivate.

11
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.833
In this first verse

12
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.625
Lord Krishna describes the first

13
00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:07.541
group of divine qualities,

14
00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:10.375
particularly those connected with detachment

15
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.125
and inner purification.

16
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.958
Let us

17
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:22.041
understand these divine qualities one by one.

18
00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:25.958
Abhayam – fearlessness.

19
00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:29.333
This does not mean the absence of hardship,

20
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:32.000
but the presence of deep faith.

21
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.583
A person becomes fearless when they know

22
00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:38.666
that Lord Krishna is their ultimate protector.

23
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:41.416
This is the mark of spiritual courage.

24
00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:44.291
The seeker, walking the path of truth, fears

25
00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:46.208
neither material

26
00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:49.083
loss nor social criticism.

27
00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:53.291
Sattva-shuddhi – inner purity.

28
00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:57.458
This is the purity of mind and intention.

29
00:01:57.458 --> 00:01:59.125
When desire, greed,

30
00:01:59.125 --> 00:01:59.916
envy,

31
00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:03.000
and ego are purified from consciousness,

32
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.333
it begins to clearly

33
00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:07.458
reflect the truth.

34
00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:13.625
Jnana-yoga-vyavasthiti – steadiness
in spiritual knowledge.

35
00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:16.083
Jnana means

36
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:19.583
knowledge of the soul and the Supreme.

37
00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:21.208
Yoga means

38
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:24.166
connecting with God through this knowledge.

39
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:28.083
Vyavasthiti means firm practice.

40
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:29.708
That is, the seeker's

41
00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:33.458
attention must remain steadily
on this knowledge.

42
00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:34.750
It must not be distracted

43
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:38.625
by superficial paths or diversions.

44
00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:42.291
Danam – giving.

45
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:45.625
Giving is not limited to money.

46
00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:48.375
It is a mindset of contribution –

47
00:02:48.375 --> 00:02:50.333
giving time, resources,

48
00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:52.416
even affection.

49
00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:56.166
Giving reduces greed, expands the heart,

50
00:02:56.166 --> 00:03:00.916
and leads the soul toward selflessness.

51
00:03:00.916 --> 00:03:04.875
Damah – sense control.

52
00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:06.000
This is control over the eyes,

53
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.250
ears, tongue,

54
00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.750
and the other outer senses.

55
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.375
One who does not blindly chase the senses 

56
00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:17.000
becomes strong from within.

57
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.791
This is the foundation of spiritual progress.

58
00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:23.958
Yajnah – sacrifice.

59
00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:25.250
This means

60
00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.500
offering every action to the Lord.

61
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.583
Whether it is the sacred fire, japa, or service –

62
00:03:32.583 --> 00:03:36.708
when action becomes offering, that is yajna.

63
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:39.708
The spirit of yajna is this –
what one has received,

64
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:42.750
offering it back to the source.

65
00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:47.166
Svadhyayah – study of scriptures.

66
00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:51.500
Sva + adhyaya means, to purify the soul

67
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.208
and connect it with truth,

68
00:03:53.208 --> 00:03:56.041
the regular study of scriptures.

69
00:03:56.041 --> 00:03:58.625
This is not merely intellectual knowledge, but

70
00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:01.791
a means to purify consciousness.

71
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:04.958
Tapah – austerity.

72
00:04:04.958 --> 00:04:08.041
This means voluntarily accepting difficulty –

73
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:11.083
like fasting, discipline of time,

74
00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.958
control of speech.

75
00:04:12.958 --> 00:04:16.125
Its aim is not punishment, but to
develop inner strength

76
00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:20.625
and self-mastery.

77
00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:21.916
Arjavam

78
00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:25.833
means simplicity and honesty.

79
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:29.375
This is directness in thought, word,
and conduct.

80
00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:30.875
Such a person is the same inside

81
00:04:30.875 --> 00:04:33.791
and outside.

82
00:04:33.791 --> 00:04:35.708
They do not deceive,

83
00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.375
so they naturally

84
00:04:37.375 --> 00:04:39.541
become worthy of trust.

85
00:04:39.541 --> 00:04:42.416
In the next two verses, Lord Krishna

86
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:44.708
will describe more divine qualities.

87
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.041
You may think

88
00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:55.125
that fearlessness means speaking in

89
00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:57.583
a loud voice, appearing tough,

90
00:04:57.583 --> 00:05:01.541
or suppressing emotions.

91
00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:03.708
But

92
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:06.625
true fearlessness comes

93
00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:08.166
when you

94
00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:12.583
place Me at the centre of your life.

95
00:05:12.583 --> 00:05:15.416
When your faith is firm,

96
00:05:15.416 --> 00:05:19.458
fear's grip loosens.

97
00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:23.666
I have called the first divine quality

98
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:27.083
abhayam.

99
00:05:27.083 --> 00:05:30.791
This is not the absence of fear,

100
00:05:30.791 --> 00:05:34.875
but the presence of faith.

101
00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:38.416
You do not become fearless when

102
00:05:38.416 --> 00:05:42.750
you know how life will unfold.

103
00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.708
You become fearless

104
00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:50.041
when it feels certain to you

105
00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:53.375
that I am with you.

106
00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:56.208
Whatever happens,

107
00:05:56.208 --> 00:05:59.208
when you see this life as temporary

108
00:05:59.208 --> 00:06:03.250
and Me as eternal,

109
00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.708
your perspective changes.

110
00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:11.875
You do not fear loss, failure, or criticism.

111
00:06:11.875 --> 00:06:14.625
You stand steady

112
00:06:14.625 --> 00:06:18.625
and walk through change, because

113
00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:23.958
your foundation is not outside, but within.

114
00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:27.916
I am in your heart.

115
00:06:27.916 --> 00:06:34.250
This fearlessness is not pride, it is surrender.

116
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:38.000
It grows slowly.

117
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.708
As you allow your daily remembrance of Me

118
00:06:41.708 --> 00:06:45.000
and your connection with Me to deepen,

119
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.875
then when fear arises,

120
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:50.958
do not fight it alone.

121
00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:53.583
Connect with Me.

122
00:06:53.583 --> 00:06:57.291
I will give you that courage

123
00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:59.666
you are searching for.

124
00:07:04.541 --> 00:07:07.666
Peace in your family

125
00:07:07.666 --> 00:07:10.708
does not come from grand displays.

126
00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:16.250
It arises from simple sincerity.

127
00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:20.166
I have called arjavam, that is,

128
00:07:20.166 --> 00:07:24.333
straightforwardness and integrity,
a divine quality.

129
00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:28.416
This means being the same inside

130
00:07:28.416 --> 00:07:32.000
and outside both.

131
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.708
No pretence, no hidden agenda,

132
00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:38.625
no double language.

133
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:41.416
When you speak clearly,

134
00:07:41.416 --> 00:07:43.875
say what is in your heart,

135
00:07:43.875 --> 00:07:46.833
and do what you say –

136
00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:50.458
your family feels safe.

137
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:53.666
Children are less confused.

138
00:07:53.666 --> 00:07:56.875
A partner finds trust.

139
00:07:56.875 --> 00:08:00.541
Parents feel respected.

140
00:08:00.541 --> 00:08:03.375
You do not need to show

141
00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:07.166
perfection to impress each other.

142
00:08:07.166 --> 00:08:11.041
You only need to be real.

143
00:08:11.041 --> 00:08:12.583
Speak from the heart.

144
00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:15.375
Admit when you have made a mistake.

145
00:08:15.375 --> 00:08:19.583
And when someone speaks, listen carefully.

146
00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:22.875
The clearer your words

147
00:08:22.875 --> 00:08:27.208
and the purer your intentions,

148
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:31.125
the deeper the family bond becomes.

149
00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:33.833
This is what grows love –

150
00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:36.416
not complexity, but clarity.

151
00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:43.791
At your workplace

152
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:46.750
you are often told –

153
00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.291
compete, protect your edge,

154
00:08:51.291 --> 00:08:55.083
and think about what you will gain.

155
00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:57.041
But

156
00:08:57.041 --> 00:08:59.666
I have called

157
00:08:59.666 --> 00:09:02.333
danam – giving – a divine quality.

158
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:06.083
Even in the field of work,

159
00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:10.083
giving is not only of money.

160
00:09:10.083 --> 00:09:12.625
It is also of your time, your experience,

161
00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:16.916
and your presence.

162
00:09:16.916 --> 00:09:20.333
When you teach a colleague,

163
00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:22.125
patiently guide

164
00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:26.250
someone junior, or openly

165
00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.500
share your knowledge,

166
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.291
this is not ordinary help.

167
00:09:33.291 --> 00:09:35.291
You may think –

168
00:09:35.291 --> 00:09:38.666
‘If I get no benefit,

169
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:40.875
why should I help?’

170
00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:42.583
But

171
00:09:42.583 --> 00:09:45.208
when your giving

172
00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:48.125
is without any self-interest,

173
00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:51.625
the atmosphere changes.

174
00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:54.333
The office feels lighter.

175
00:09:54.333 --> 00:09:57.083
People begin to trust more,

176
00:09:57.083 --> 00:10:01.291
and the workplace gives a feeling of sanctity.

177
00:10:01.291 --> 00:10:05.875
Just as the incense placed before
the Lord in a temple

178
00:10:05.875 --> 00:10:10.125
delights everyone with its fragrance,

179
00:10:10.125 --> 00:10:11.500
in the same way

180
00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:17.750
let your cooperation too be an effort
to give joy to all.

181
00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.083
The one who gives

182
00:10:19.083 --> 00:10:24.166
without fear and without ego,

183
00:10:24.166 --> 00:10:27.833
that one becomes the channel of My grace.

184
00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:31.875
Even if the fruit is not seen immediately,

185
00:10:31.875 --> 00:10:34.875
even then, I am watching.

186
00:10:34.875 --> 00:10:36.875
Therefore,

187
00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:39.833
give with a generous heart, where

188
00:10:39.833 --> 00:10:43.875
service flows naturally.

189
00:10:43.875 --> 00:10:46.833
And when that happens,

190
00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:50.833
I will fill it with divinity Myself.
